# What `npm run build` uses, on top of `.env`.
#
# Tracked, unlike `.env`, because none of it is a secret: it is the shape of the
# deployment rather than a credential. See client/README.md.

# The mount. Matches `website_route_rules` in manna_hr/hooks.py, and the app is
# then at https://mannarubber.m.frappe.cloud/hr — change one and the other is a
# 404 on every deep link.
VITE_ROUTE_BASE=/hr

# Emptied on purpose, overriding the value in `.env`.
#
# Served from the site, the desk is the same origin, and `deskBase()` falls back
# to `window.location.origin` — which is the right answer and stays right if the
# site is ever renamed or a second one is stood up for staging. A hostname baked
# into the bundle would send somebody from the staging dashboard to the live
# desk, and the two look identical once the form is open.
VITE_DESK_URL=
